This experimental module adapts the listen-only event tap and held-state
reconciliation design to Whale's existing 83-key protocol and a Node-API
boundary. It adds wheel input, asynchronous ownership/cleanup, bounded queue
handling and a no-prompt isolated-app acceptance harness. It does not include
BongoCat application binaries, permission-flow, Swift UI, gamepads, Cubism or
character assets. BongoCat's root contains no NOTICE file at that revision.

